     6	// Then, in order:
     7	//   1. Done already? Any COMPLETE folder weekly/<key>-*/ → "already done"; nothing is started.
     8	//   2. Running already? This database's operations, filtered to exports whose prefix is gs://<bucket>/weekly/<key>-:
     9	//      one not done → wait on it. One done SUCCESSFUL → its folder must now be complete ("already done"), else throw
