     1	// vaultFresh's answer (V9): is the newest COMPLETE export in the vault bucket at most 7 days 18 hours old? An uptime
     2	// check calls it every 15 minutes; failing for 6 hours emails Christie, so the email lands at about 8 days. Pure: the
     3	// bucket and the clock are passed in.
     4	//
     5	//   200 {case: "fresh"} — the newest complete export is at most 7 d 18 h old;
     6	//   503 {case: "stale"} — it's older;  503 {case: "none"} — there's no complete export at all;
     7	//   500 {case: "error"} — anything else (the handler catches it), e.g. vault-watch@ can no longer list the bucket.
     8	// The body holds only the case, the folder name and its age: never member data (there is none in a listing anyway).
